    <div id="root"><div style="max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 20px;color:#dce4f5;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Apple SD Gothic Neo',sans-serif"><h1>무료 웹게임 아케이드</h1><p class="games-subtitle">1989v 게임은 설치·회원가입 없이 즐기는 무료 웹게임 서비스입니다. 원하는 장르를 골라 바로 플레이하세요.</p><nav aria-label="장르"><a href="/games/genre/defense">디펜스</a> · <a href="/games/genre/action">액션</a> · <a href="/games/genre/strategy">전략</a> · <a href="/games/genre/rpg">RPG</a> · <a href="/games/genre/arcade">아케이드</a> · <a href="/games/genre/puzzle">퍼즐</a> · <a href="/games/genre/versus">대전</a> · <a href="/games/genre/casual">캐주얼</a> · <a href="/games/genre/decider">순서 정하기</a></nav><ul><li><a href="/games/duel-defense"><img src="/games/duel-defense/assets/battlefield.png" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="대전 디펜스 — 전략 웹게임 화면" /> 대전 디펜스</a> · 전략</li><li><a href="/games/marine-command"><img src="/games/marine-command/assets/cover.png" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="궁수 키우기: 거점 원정 — RPG 웹게임 화면" /> 궁수 키우기: 거점 원정</a> · RPG</li><li><a href="/games/epoch-of-nations"><img src="/games/thumbs/shots/epoch-of-nations.jpg" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="EPOCH OF NATIONS — 전략 웹게임 화면" /> EPOCH OF NATIONS</a> · 전략</li><li><a href="/games/gwiyahaeng"><img src="/games/thumbs/shots/gwiyahaeng.png" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="귀야행 척준경 — 액션 웹게임 화면" /> 귀야행 척준경</a> · 액션</li><li><a href="/games/landslide"><img src="/games/thumbs/shots/landslide.jpg" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="사태 — 대전 웹게임 화면" /> 사태</a> · 대전</li><li><a href="/games/arena"><img src="/games/thumbs/shots/arena.jpg" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="AMP ARENA — 대전 웹게임 화면" /> AMP ARENA</a> · 대전</li><li><a href="/games/circle-trace">원 그리기</a> · 캐주얼</li><li><a href="/games/seven-seconds">7초를 맞춰라</a> · 캐주얼</li><li><a href="/games/zombie-lane"><img src="/games/thumbs/shots/zombie-lane.jpg" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" alt="좀비 레인 — 아케이드 웹게임 화면" /> 좀비 레인</a> · 아케이드</li><li><a href=